   "The mountain nymph seduces you and you start taking off your armor." 
   "The mountain nymph steals the +3 Grayswandir." --More--
   "The mountain nymph steals a blessed bag of holding." --More--
   "The mountain nymph steals a wand of fire (6)." --More--
