   AAAAAAAAAAAAAUUUUUGGGH!!!!!!!!!!!!!! 
   swear curse moan hate growl bitchbitchbitchbitchbitch.

   In retrospect, I must admire that nymph's skill.  Fast hands.  Very fast.
   The character survived for several hundred more moves, but the lethal 
   damage was done there, as I had _no_ other weapons or ranged attacks
   available.  From now on, I'm carrying a backup weapon! 

   The nymph, lamentably, lives still.  She must have gotten her hands on a
   wand of speed monster someplace, too.  The one time I saw her again, she 
   easily outran me while zapping me twice with the wand.  I pity anyone 
   who finds that bones level...  that nymph is going to be very hard to 
   kill.

Actually, it's better for the bones finder that she's alive.  Recently a
nymph stole my Myollnir...  But nymphs are airheads!  They doesn't use
weapons (preferring affection to fighting?  After all, *they* never kill
you. ;^), so since they're their normal wimpy selves, they can still be
killed if you're fast enough and powerful enough (with maybe a backup
weapon in a chest as insurance if you're the cautious type).  On the other
hand, were that bones-nymph dead, a mere gnome would wander by, pick up the
weapons & armour, and waste you.

